  ],
  "Body": {
    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>Azure Marketplace pay-as-you-go images for SQL Server 2019 on <a href=\"https://azuremarketplace.microsoft.com/marketplace/apps/microsoftsqlserver.sql2019-rhel8?tab=Overview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">RHEL 8.0</a>, <a href=\"https://azuremarketplace.microsoft.com/marketplace/apps/microsoftsqlserver.sql2019-ubuntu1804?tab=Overview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Ubuntu 18.04</a>, and <a href=\"https://azuremarketplace.microsoft.com/marketplace/apps/microsoftsqlserver.sql2019-sles12sp5?tab=Overview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">SLES 12 SP5</a> are now generally available. Deploy these images today and get the latest of both SQL Server 2019 functionality and operating system improvements.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://techcommunity.microsoft.com/t5/sql-server/sql-server-2019-images-with-current-linux-distribution-support/ba-p/1251539\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Learn more about this announcement</a>.</p>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "Azure Marketplace pay-as-you-go images for SQL Server 2019 on RHEL 8.0 , Ubuntu 18.04 , and SLES 12 SP5 are now generally available. Deploy these images today and get the latest of both SQL Server 2019 functionality and operating system improvements.\n\nLearn more about this announcement ."
  },
